<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width">
<title>Email change request</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f7;font-family:-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1f2328;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="background:#f4f4f7;padding:32px 16px;">
<tr><td align="center">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="max-width:520px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e3e5e8;">
<tr><td style="padding:32px 32px 8px;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;">Email change request</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 32px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;">
<p style="margin:12px 0;">Hello,</p>
<p style="margin:12px 0;">Someone signed in to <strong>{{.InstanceName}}</strong> asked to use this email address for their account, but it already belongs to an account there, so nothing was changed.</p>
<p style="margin:12px 0;">If that was you, you are already using this address on another account. Sign in with it instead, or reset that account&#39;s password from the sign-in page if you have forgotten it.</p>
<p style="margin:12px 0;font-size:13px;color:#57606a;">If it was not you, you can ignore this email.</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 32px 28px;font-size:12px;color:#8b949e;">{{.InstanceName}}</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
